# The area editor (olc.c's framework, olc_act.c's aedit_*), with Planner (security 9) in Midgaard (area 3), and
# Delver (security 0).
# - edit, alist, aedit with a bad vnum; in the editor: an empty line and show, version, commands, ? and its
#   lists (sector, spec, the paged liquid and weapon lists, spells by target), an unknown word to the interpreter
# - a word that's a prefix of an area flag toggles it first: c (changed), a (added), n (none, no change)
# - name, credits, filename (too long, two words, good), age, security (over his own, good), vnum, lvnum, uvnum
#   with each refusal; reset; done; asave changed saves it under its new file name
# - builder: added to "None"; "del" is found inside "Delver" and leaves "ver" (strstr); "ver" isn't found (the
#   name is capitalised, and strstr is case-sensitive), so it's added: "Ver Ver"
# - Delver, named a builder, may edit Midgaard, but not set security over his own; once he's taken off the list
#   (the area is at security 5), his next line throws him out of the editor
# - aedit create: a new area is "area0.are" with no credits ("(null)"), saved with asave changed; the syntax
#   messages; vnums inside Midgaard (3050) are already assigned, but 2990, in the gap below it, isn't, so
#   "vnum 2990 3050" sets the lower one only; adding and removing the only builder gives "None" back
# - Delver can't edit Valhalla (area 0) at all
# - the prompt's %o and %O in the editor and out of it; a mob can't use the editor
@connect b
Planner
smoke123
@return
@return
goto 3001
force hassan aedit
force hassan edit area
force hassan alist
edit
edit nonsense
alist
aedit 999
aedit 3
@return
show
version
commands
?
? sector
? spec
? liquid
@return
? weapon
@return
? spells
? spells all
? spells attack
? spells bogus
? nothing
xyzzy
c
a
n
show
name
name New Midgaard
credits
credits { All } Diku    New Midgaard
filename toolongname
filename ab cd
filename mid2
age
age 5
security 10
security 5
builder
builder delver
builder del
builder ver
builder planner
builder delver
vnum 3400 3000
vnum 3000 3500
vnum 2900 3399
lvnum 99999
lvnum 3000
uvnum 1
uvnum 3500
uvnum 3399
reset
look
show
@connect d
Delver
psswrd
@return
aedit create
aedit
security 5
show
@as b
builder delver
@as d
show
look
@as b
done
show
asave changed
@file mid2.are
@file area.lst
prompt <%o %O>
aedit create
show
name Test Area
filename newarea
vnum 30000 30099
filename
security
vnum 1
lvnum
uvnum
vnum 3050 3060
vnum 2990 3050
uvnum 3050
lvnum 3050
builder planner
builder planner
done
@as d
aedit 0
@as b
asave changed
@file newarea.are
@file area.lst
aedit 3
prompt <%hhp %mm %vmv>
done
